  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support reform and global health priorities via World Health Organization, 2024-28: Core contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide core funding to the World Health Organization (WHO) to support its 14th General Programme of Work(GPW14) which sets out how WHO&apos;s work  will be organised over the 5 years; how  the work of the Organization contributes to the achievement of a clearly defined set of outcomes and impacts; and the means by which WHO can be held accountable for the way resources are used to achieve specified results.</narrative>
  </description>
